Description: RimWorld colony interface for live AI coding agents
 Includes the Linux session daemon, CLI, launcher, and RimWorld 1.6 mod.
 RimWorld must be installed separately. See /usr/share/doc/slopworld/README.Debian
 for mod attachment and per-user daemon setup.
